id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (server: handlers return ApiResult; ApiError built by struct literal with TS's code and message)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box (server route handlers: for<'a> fn(&'a App, Req) -> Pin<Box<dyn Future + Send + 'a>> via h!)
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only (event = "<TS event>", camelCase quoted field names, alert = ERROR)
time.server: app::now_ms() -> i64 epoch ms, wall clock anchored once and advanced by tokio's clock
route.table: app::ROUTES: &[(&str method, &str path, AuthLevel, Handler)] in TS allRoutes() order
db.paths: db::store::{Db, Tx, Profile, ...} (SURFACE's db::Db written as db::store::Db)
